# A counter the inner loop steps 4 times per outer trip, read after it:
# ptxas stores 16 B apart, at param_0 + 0x10 to + 0x80. The outer
# counter steps by the inner loop's exit, 4 trips of 1, and the read
# after the inner loop takes its counter at 4: the store is at
# param_0 + 16·k, k = iv + 1 the outer loop's iteration.
RUN: %ptxroof analyze %fixtures/micro/nested_counter_step.ptx | FileCheck --check-prefix=ANN "%s"
ANN: {{^}}	st.global.u32 	[%rd3], %r5; // global store [16·iv[$L__BB0_1] + param_0 + 16] sectors/req 1 (ideal 1){{$}}
